{"obsah":"<p>We had plenty of work over the weekend. Part of the team led by Lukáš Valný headed to Moravia for a cycling day in Libhošť, where Matouš Balík, Tobík Dolák and Lukáš showed what they could at a smaller event for cycling enthusiasts. Martin Šimůnek, Vlasta Kabeláč Čiháček, Dalibor Šulc and Marty Kabeláč, meanwhile, were in Dolní Poustevna celebrating the Village of the Year, which was full of concerts and programmes for kids and adults. In two shows we presented a combination of a motorbike, a mountain bike, a smaller 24\" bike and kids' Trial. Because of the space we used fewer obstacles, but it was still packed, the spectators cheered like crazy and egged us on to a few bigger jumps.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F09%2FIMG_2768.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F09%2FIMG_2768.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-238313\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F09%2F378073774_218884071159709_3106707032719458866_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F09%2F378073774_218884071159709_3106707032719458866_n.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-238312\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F09%2F378086461_1073644033606404_7688892442413196610_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.